  m_Name: item_l19_incident_review
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GlorifiedBody.Interaction.ItemDefinition
  itemId: l19_incident_review
  displayName: A DICTAPHONE
  kind: 6
  drugType: 0
  colour: {r: 0.95, g: 0.55, b: 0.2, a: 1}
  description: A recording. It plays while she walks. A fight pauses it.
  logText: 'Incident review. V4 series, unit two. Recorded for the file.


    Summary.
    The unit was held at the standard interval for PCDH-Y. The replacement batch
    did not arrive on the day.


    Logistics reports a hold at the hub. Six days.


    On
    day six the nursing team entered to administer the replacement. The unit was
    in deficit. It did not wait for the injection.


    The unit fed on a member
    of staff.


    The team withdrew. The unit did not pursue.


    Exams on day
    seven. Levels within the normal range. Accelerated healing of every wound the
    unit sustained in the incident, confirmed on imaging. The unit is calm.


    Recommendation.
    Do not hold a batch. Never enter alone. End of review.'
  readFlag: feed_unlocked
  mapFloor: 
  audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 139cd5abd2ee765db8ecef896e8b8dfb, type: 3}
